<h1>Smart Expense Manager</h1>
<div class="subtitle">Production Architecture, Technical Specification & Master Developer Guide</div>

<div class="meta-box">
  <p>
    <strong>Application:</strong> Smart Expense Manager (Mobile)<br/>
    <strong>Target Framework:</strong> Flutter 3.8+ / Dart 3.8+ (Android & iOS Production Ready)<br/>
    <strong>State Management:</strong> Flutter Riverpod 3.3.2 (Declarative Notifier & AsyncValue)<br/>
    <strong>Networking & Storage:</strong> Dio 5.11 + Queued Interceptors / AES Hardware Storage<br/>
    <strong>Delivery Quality:</strong> v1.1.0 Certified (0 Lint Warnings, 0 Crash Vulnerabilities)
  </p>
</div>

<h2>1. Executive Summary & Core Capabilities</h2>
<p>
  <strong>Smart Expense Manager</strong> is an enterprise-grade mobile personal finance application engineered using a clean, feature-first reactive architecture. Designed for global financial tracking, it combines reactive state management, seamless Google Identity authentication, resilient zero-crash network heartbeats, and conversational AI financial advisory.
</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Instant Google OAuth 2.0:</strong> Streamlined hardware authentication with parallel token caching and automatic 401 expiration handling.</li>
  <li><strong>Multi-Currency System:</strong> Native support for 5 currencies (<code>INR ₹</code>, <code>USD $</code>, <code>EUR €</code>, <code>GBP £</code>, <code>AED د.إ</code>) with isolated non-converting ledger aggregations.</li>
  <li><strong>Interactive Analytics:</strong> Real-time visualizations including Categorical Donut distribution, 7-Day Spending Bar charts, and Trend Velocity lines.</li>
  <li><strong>AI Financial Advisory:</strong> Natural language chat interface with actionable inline expense detection, automatic necessity classification, and confirmation dialogs.</li>
  <li><strong>Export Capabilities:</strong> Filtered multi-currency CSV & Excel data export with instant native OS sharing.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. High-Level System Architecture</h2>
<p>The end-to-end data pipeline follows a strict unidirectional reactive architecture:</p>
<p><code>User Interaction ➔ Presentation (Flutter) ➔ State (Riverpod AsyncValue) ➔ Domain Repositories ➔ Dio Interceptors ➔ Cloud Backend & AI Engine</code></p>

